{% comment %}
  Adivasi Authentic How-To-Use Ritual Page Section
{% endcomment %}

<div class="adivasi-ritual-page section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
  <div class="page-width page-width--narrow">
    <div class="adivasi-ritual-page__header">
      <span class="adivasi-ritual-page__pill">VEDIC APPLICATION GUIDE</span>
      <h1 class="adivasi-ritual-page__title">The Traditional Adivasi Hair Ritual</h1>
      <p class="adivasi-ritual-page__desc">
        Follow this 300-year-old ancestral application method to achieve maximum follicular absorption and visible hair fall control in 14 days.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Step Cards -->
    <div class="adivasi-ritual-page__steps">
      <div class="adivasi-ritual-card">
        <div class="adivasi-ritual-card__badge">STEP 1</div>
        <h3>Gently Warm the Oil</h3>
        <p>Take 10ml to 15ml (approx. 2 tablespoons) of Adivasi oil in a small glass or copper bowl. Place this bowl inside a larger bowl of warm water for 2-3 minutes (Indirect heating). <strong>Never microwave or boil directly on stove.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="adivasi-ritual-card">
        <div class="adivasi-ritual-card__badge">STEP 2</div>
        <h3>Circular Scalp Massage (10 Minutes)</h3>
        <p>Part your hair into clean rows. Using the soft pads of your fingertips (not fingernails), gently massage the warm oil in slow circular motions. Focus especially on crown thinning areas and receding temples to boost blood flow.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="adivasi-ritual-card">
        <div class="adivasi-ritual-card__badge">STEP 3</div>
        <h3>Overnight Deep Herb Absorption</h3>
        <p>Leave the oil in your hair overnight to allow the 108 wild herbs to penetrate 3 layers deep. Wash off the following morning using a mild herbal shampoo. Repeat 3 times a week (e.g. Tuesday, Thursday, Sunday).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Dos and Don'ts -->
    <div class="adivasi-ritual-guidelines">
      <div class="adivasi-guideline-box is-do">
        <h4>DO's for Faster Regrowth</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>✓ Use a wide-tooth neem wooden comb to detangle hair gently.</li>
          <li>✓ Drink plenty of water and maintain a protein-rich diet.</li>
          <li>✓ Be consistent for minimum 6 to 8 weeks for permanent baby hair growth.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="adivasi-guideline-box is-dont">
        <h4>DON'Ts to Avoid Follicle Damage</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>✗ Do not tie your hair tightly immediately after applying oil.</li>
          <li>✗ Do not use boiling hot water to wash your scalp.</li>
          <li>✗ Avoid chemical heat styling irons and heavy bleaching dyes.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="adivasi-ritual-page__cta-box">
      <h3>Ready to Begin Your Hair Regrowth Journey?</h3>
      <p>Order 100% genuine Pakshirajapura oil directly on Cash on Delivery with free delivery.</p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="adivasi-ritual-page__btn">
        ORDER NOW &bull; CASH ON DELIVERY (COD)
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
